"Tanglebay is the secret home of Syl the slime and Vee the spider, two reborn Experiments."
"Sylbera is not a dwarf but a persona run by one of Syl's slime cores, Sub-Core Beta."
"A slime core named Pi sits on the island for good, and a slime network covers the land."
"Leon is a reborn soul too, a crab Experiment of the god Unc, sworn not to harm Syl."
"Vee's first portal node of The Web opened on Tanglebay, and Garz's goblins came through it."
"Syl pads the island with her slime, so she could revive through its cores if killed."
"Syl hopes to raise a slime dungeon on Tanglebay once her dungeon master claim is approved."
